## 9. Deterministic Validation and Approval Gates

**PLANNED FOR STEP 3 — NOT ACTIVE IN STEP 1 OR STEP 2**

### The 14 Required Validation Checks

Every staffing proposal must pass all 14 checks before reaching the approval gate. iStaffing Validator is responsible for executing these checks.

| # | Check | Type |
|---|-------|------|
| 1 | Availability check | Hard constraint |
| 2 | Credential check | Hard constraint |
| 3 | License check | Hard constraint |
| 4 | Competency check | Hard or soft depending on requirement flag |
| 5 | Required training check | Hard constraint |
| 6 | Patient restriction check | Hard constraint |
| 7 | Facility restriction check | Hard constraint |
| 8 | Conflict check | Hard constraint |
| 9 | Overtime check | Hard constraint (CA labor law) |
| 10 | Rest-period check | Hard constraint (CA labor law) |
| 11 | Continuity-of-care check | Soft — scored, not blocking |
| 12 | Fairness/workload balancing check | Soft — scored, flagged if severe |
| 13 | Approval requirement check | Meta — determines if human approval gate is required |
| 14 | Audit readiness check | Meta — ensures all required fields are populated for logging |

### Hard Disqualifiers (Layer 1 — Blocks Immediately, No Override)

The following conditions cause iStaffing Validator to block a proposal immediately. No human may override a hard disqualifier.

| # | Rule | Regulatory Source |
|---|------|-------------------|
| 1 | Discipline mismatch | Physician order per §484.60 |
| 2 | Credential expired or invalid | §484.115 |
| 3 | License expired | §484.115 |
| 4 | Hard patient restriction active | Safety |
| 5 | Religious accommodation conflict | FEHA Layer 1 |
| 6 | ADA accommodation conflict | FEHA Layer 1 |
| 7 | FMLA/pregnancy leave active | FEHA Layer 1 |
| 8 | CA legal work hours exceeded | CA Labor Law |
| 9 | Clinician status not active | Basic eligibility |
| 10 | Visit capacity at maximum | Capacity |

### Ranking Factors (Layer 2 — Scored, Not Blocking)

After hard disqualifiers filter the eligible pool, these factors produce a weighted match score for ranking candidates:

| # | Factor | Weight Range | Notes |
|---|--------|-------------|-------|
| 1 | Distance | +0 to +20 | Closer = higher score |
| 2 | Continuity | +0 to +15 | Scaled by patient's continuity priority |
| 3 | Skill exact match | +0 to +10 | Beyond minimum credential |
| 4 | Feedback score | +0 to +10 | Only if bias-audited per FEHA |
| 5 | Language match | +0 to +5 | Must be monitored for mileage disparity |
| 6 | Workload balance | +0 to +10 | Less-loaded clinician preferred |
| 7 | Patient preference | +0 to +10 | Patient/family request |
| 8 | Clinician preference | +0 to +5 | Clinician preference for zone/type |
| 9 | Overtime risk | -15 | If approaching OT threshold |
| 10 | Novice on complex case | -10 | Low-experience on L3-L4 acuity |
| 11 | Soft restriction | -20 | Soft block; override possible with documentation |

### Scoring Formula

```
matchScore = 50 (base)
  + distanceBonus           (max +20)
  + continuityBonus         (max +15, scaled by continuityPriority)
  + skillExactMatch         (max +10)
  + feedbackBonus           (max +10, IF bias-audited)
  + languageMatch           (max +5, monitored for disparate impact)
  + workloadBalance         (max +10)
  + patientPreference       (max +10)
  + clinicianPreference     (max +5)
  - overtimeRisk            (-15 if approaching)
  - noviceOnComplex         (-10 if applicable)
  - softRestriction         (-20 if active)

Max theoretical score: 100
Minimum for recommended assignment: Configurable (suggested: 60)
```

### Approval Requirements

| Condition | Required Approver |
|-----------|------------------|
| First-time clinician-patient connection | ACCM / Clinical Manager |
| Override of iStaffing Scheduler recommendation | Clinical Manager (§484.115 qualified) |
| High-acuity (L3-L4) patient — new assignment | Clinical Manager |
| Bias-flagged proposal | Clinical Manager (must review and document) |
| Expanded radius (>25 miles) | Scheduler or Clinical Manager |
| PRN or overtime assignment | Clinical Manager or Admin |
| Expired required credential (any) | BLOCKED — no override allowed |

