| maxVisitsPerWeek | number | Weekly visit cap (tied to OT after 40hrs) |
| createdAt | timestamp | Audit |
| updatedAt | timestamp | Audit |
| createdBy | UUID | Audit |

**Accommodation Fields (P0 Compliance — FEHA ADS Layer 1 Hard Constraints):**

| Field | Type | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| religiousRestrictions[] | {day, timeRange, description} | Days/times unavailable for religious observance |
| adaAccommodations[] | {type, description, effectiveDate} | Disability accommodations |
| pregnancyAccommodation | {active, details, expectedEndDate} | Pregnancy-related scheduling limits |
| fmlaLeave | {active, startDate, endDate} | FMLA leave dates |
